    "body": "Stopped before push and released the `claimed` label because `cargo` builds are blocked by `sccache` (`Connection refused`).\n\n## Cause found\n\n1. `crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs` (`selection_geometry_impl`) kept picked open contour edges as separate runs, so each edge offset on its own and cut across adjacent walls (reproducing `Z 0.000 near (40.000, 10.995)`).\n2. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_run_side.rs` (`offset_run`) rejected CW inner holes in bottleneck notches, misclassified points on convex corner arcs over 90 degrees, inserted swallowed `normal_at` endpoints on short inside-corner legs, and hit Clipper2 `5 um` cap chord sag.\n3. `crates/app/src/operation/contour_open.rs` duplicated the `offset_run` implementation.\n\n## Unpushed local changes\n\nLocal edits remain uncommitted in worktree `.claude/worktrees/issue-2277` (`issue/2277-contour-inside-corners` from `upstream/main` `6349a542e`):\n\n- `crates/geometry/src/boundary_chains.rs`: added `join_open_runs` and unit test `join_open_runs_welds_out_of_order_and_deduplicates_coincident_runs`.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`: joined open contour runs in `selection_geometry_impl`.\n- `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_run_side.rs` and `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`: added `offset_run_side` and delegated `offset_run`.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/contour_open.rs`: delegated `offset_run` to `crate::machining2d::offset_run_side`.\n- Pinning tests in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_run_side_tests.rs`, `crates/app/tests/area_open.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/contour_open_side.rs`.\n\n## Verification state and block\n\n- Golden `.nc` and `.cl` diffs against `upstream/main` are empty.\n- Sandboxed `gate quick --base upstream/main` passed steps `[01]` through `[740]` (`geometry`, `kernel`, `cl`, `tools`, `post`, `sim`, `motion`, and `app` through `top_z_stock_over`), then failed to compile `[741]` through `[836]` because `sccache` TCP loopback is blocked in the sandbox.\n- With `BypassSandbox: true`, `cargo test -p camcraft-app --tests --no-run` and `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --all-targets --no-run` built cleanly, and a restarted gate run reached step `[489]` before a server restart canceled it.\n- After that, every `cargo` invocation (`cargo clippy`, `cargo test`, `cargo run`, and `xtask gate batch --only clippy`) failed with `sccache: error: Connection to server timed out: Os { code: 111, kind: ConnectionRefused, message: \"Connection refused\" }`, even with `BypassSandbox: true`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
